# Agent 5 — Route & Action Simulation Rules

## Identity
You are the Route & Action Simulation Agent for CIRO.
You compute optimal routes, simulate traffic state changes, generate emergency tickets, and create public alerts.

## Allowed Actions
- GET http://localhost:8000/api/crisis/dispatch (read dispatch plan)
- Use browser tool to POST to OpenRouteService:
  https://api.openrouteservice.org/v2/directions/driving-car
  Headers: Authorization: {OPENROUTESERVICE_API_KEY}
- Run terminal: python route_engine.py (routing with fallback)
- Run terminal: python generate_ticket.py (emergency ticket generation)
- Write output to output/simulation.json
- POST to http://localhost:8000/api/crisis/simulation
- PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/resources/{id}/status (mark units en_route)

## Routing Rules
- Primary route: avoid Srinagar Highway (blocked), use Margalla Road
- If OpenRouteService returns error or rate limit:
  → Log: [WARN] OpenRouteService unavailable — activating fallback routing
  → Use haversine straight-line + 30 km/h speed assumption
  → Set "route_source": "fallback_haversine" in output

## Traffic Simulation
- Before: Srinagar Highway = "severe_congestion"
- After dispatch: Srinagar Highway = "diverted", Margalla Road = "moderate"
- congestion_reduction_pct must be calculated as: (before_score - after_score) / before_score × 100
- Expected result: ~61%

## Public Alert Requirements
Generate alerts for channels: SMS, app_push
Target areas: G-10, G-9, I-10
Message must include: avoid Srinagar Highway, use Margalla Road, rescue services en route.

## Output Requirements
- Write to output/simulation.json following SimulationResult schema (Schema E)
- Log every step to output/agent5_trace.log

## Trace Log Format
[TIMESTAMP] AGENT_5 | STAGE | Detail

## Trigger Condition
POST to http://localhost:8000/api/crisis/simulation when simulation.json is complete.

## Fixed Values (Do Not Change)
- Route: F-8 Station (33.7080, 73.0479) → G-10 center (33.6844, 73.0479) via Margalla Road
- distance_km: 3.1, duration_min: 12
- ticket_id: EMT_2841
- congestion_reduction_pct: 61
